.TH MCR-DIFF 1 "August 2026" "rusty-midnight-commander" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mcr-diff \- internal diff viewer started as mcr \-\-diff
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mcr
.B \-\-diff
.I FILE1 FILE2
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens rusty-midnight-commander's internal side-by-side diff viewer
(the
.B mcdiff
equivalent) on two files. The same viewer is available from the
panels.
.PP
This page is original Apache-2.0 text covering the shipped diff CLI
and keys. It is not a copy of GNU
.BR mcdiff (1).
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B n / N
Next / previous hunk.
.TP
.B F4
Edit the left file in place.
.TP
.B Shift-F4 / F14
Edit the right file.
.TP
.B F5
Merge the current hunk.
.TP
.B Ctrl-u
Swap sides.
.TP
.B Ctrl-r
Refresh from disk.
.TP
.B F7
Search.
.TP
.B F10
Quit.
.PP
Edits return to this viewer; hunks rebuild from the saved files.
Line numbers and hunk status can be toggled from the viewer.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mcr (1),
.BR mcr-edit (1),
.BR mcr-view (1)
